name: test_verify_simple

nodes:
  - name: codes
    type: Map
    inputs:
      - documents

  - name: verify
    type: VerifyQuotes
    window_size: 300
    trim_spans: true
    inputs:
      - codes

---#codes

Extract themes with supporting quotes from this text:

<text>
{{input}}
</text>

Only include direct quotes from the text above.

[[codes:codes]]
